WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.810
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:05.080 --> 00:06.920
I'll marry into your family.

3
00:07.720 --> 00:08.600
As for you,

4
00:08.600 --> 00:10.320
you have to be my bottom, though.

5
00:10.320 --> 00:11.720
This is actually nice.

6
00:11.720 --> 00:12.240
P'Ing.

7
00:12.280 --> 00:14.280
When something good happens to you,

8
00:14.280 --> 00:15.880
it's natural to look radiant.

9
00:15.920 --> 00:17.560
It's about that tryout at the boxing gym.

10
00:17.600 --> 00:18.840
They want to sign me to a contract

11
00:18.880 --> 00:20.440
and have me train in America.

12
00:20.680 --> 00:22.360
But there's some good news.

13
00:22.560 --> 00:23.680
I know him better than anyone.

14
00:23.680 --> 00:24.640
My brother...

15
00:24.680 --> 00:26.040
hates nothing more than being lied to.

16
00:26.400 --> 00:28.160
The second you helped me,

17
00:28.200 --> 00:29.120
you'd already betrayed him.

18
00:29.120 --> 00:29.840
Itt...

19
00:30.720 --> 00:32.800
Are we still friends?

20
00:41.760 --> 00:44.840
My dear Fon, every single one of these...

21
00:44.960 --> 00:46.320
is a hard pass.

22
00:46.360 --> 00:49.400
I've already sent you a hundred designs, Mr. Ing.

23
00:49.440 --> 00:51.600
These are the absolute bestsellers.

24
00:51.600 --> 00:52.720
Bestsellers? So you mean

25
00:52.720 --> 00:54.200
everyone and their mother has one?

26
00:54.520 --> 00:56.080
No, that means

27
00:56.120 --> 00:57.040
their designs are beautiful,

28
00:57.080 --> 00:59.160
so people buy them in droves.

29
00:59.200 --> 01:01.040
Anyway, since these will be your couple rings,

30
01:01.080 --> 01:02.280
why don't you let your partner

31
01:02.280 --> 01:03.400
help you choose?

32
01:03.560 --> 01:04.800
Oh, better not.

33
01:05.200 --> 01:06.880
He has absolutely atrocious taste.

34
01:06.920 --> 01:09.000
It's a struggle just to get him to dress decently.

35
01:09.320 --> 01:11.360
Oh, atrocious taste?

36
01:11.520 --> 01:12.480
Even with such terrible taste,

37
01:12.520 --> 01:14.680
you're still into him?

38
01:14.720 --> 01:16.400
Wow, that's quite interesting.

39
01:18.680 --> 01:20.800
You talk too much. Are you doing this or not?

40
01:21.039 --> 01:22.680
If not, I'll find another shop.

41
01:22.720 --> 01:23.680
I can do it,

42
01:23.680 --> 01:24.840
but a custom design

43
01:24.880 --> 01:26.200
is gonna be very expensive.

44
01:26.200 --> 01:27.200
Are you sure you can afford it?

45
01:27.200 --> 01:29.120
Money isn't an issue.

46
01:29.320 --> 01:30.720
Never mind, I'll design them myself.

47
01:30.760 --> 01:32.160
Wait, but...

48
01:53.560 --> 01:55.320
Mr. Ing, here's your coffee.

49
01:57.360 --> 01:59.120
Should I clear away this trash?

50
01:59.120 --> 02:00.560
Yeah, throw it all away.

51
02:24.000 --> 02:25.960
Mr. Ing... Sir...

52
02:26.520 --> 02:27.480
Yes?

53
02:27.560 --> 02:28.960
Our investigation found that...

54
02:28.960 --> 02:31.240
there's a firm called Private Equity

55
02:31.360 --> 02:33.440
that gave 80 million to Green Agriculture.

56
02:34.120 --> 02:35.120
-What? -That's likely the reason

57
02:35.160 --> 02:36.680
they backed out of our deal.

58
02:37.000 --> 02:38.400
It must be because of this payout.

59
02:40.120 --> 02:41.120
I knew it.

60
02:42.920 --> 02:44.680
That lowlife couple.

61
02:52.360 --> 02:53.480
Hello, P'Ing?

62
02:53.720 --> 02:54.720
Is something up?

63
02:54.760 --> 02:55.320
Itt,

64
02:55.320 --> 02:57.560
someone pumped 80 million into that couple.

65
02:57.600 --> 02:59.240
What? I had no idea.

66
02:59.360 --> 03:00.960
They're not even picking up my calls.

67
03:00.960 --> 03:02.840
Every time I ask you something, you know nothing.

68
03:02.880 --> 03:04.240
You're completely useless.

69
03:05.160 --> 03:06.320
I'm sorry, P'Ing.

70
03:06.360 --> 03:08.240
Save it. I don't want to hear your apologies.

71
03:08.400 --> 03:09.360
Hold on.

72
03:09.880 --> 03:11.480
We have dinner at home this Friday.

73
03:11.920 --> 03:12.920
Don't forget to come.

74
03:15.160 --> 03:16.079
Yeah.

75
05:33.200 --> 05:35.280
Regarding Green Agriculture,

76
05:35.280 --> 05:36.800
what should we do, Mr. Ing?

77
05:37.720 --> 05:38.960
I'm not letting this slide.

78
05:39.240 --> 05:39.960
Please help Itt

79
05:40.000 --> 05:41.040
contact that couple

80
05:41.040 --> 05:42.240
and get them in here to talk to me.

81
05:43.280 --> 05:44.040
Yes, sir.

82
05:44.760 --> 05:45.920
[Director Chatuphon]

83
05:50.960 --> 05:53.720
Director, any updates on what's going on?

84
05:53.880 --> 05:54.720
Yes.

85
05:55.040 --> 05:57.040
That company submitted their documents today.

86
05:57.680 --> 05:59.080
The content is exactly the same,

87
05:59.200 --> 06:01.120
but they've changed the name of the shareholder

88
06:01.240 --> 06:03.160
from your company to another one.

89
06:03.560 --> 06:05.320
And do you happen to know

90
06:05.360 --> 06:07.440
which company it is?

91
06:08.080 --> 06:09.560
I'm looking into it.

92
06:09.960 --> 06:11.560
I'll let you know as soon as I find out.

93
06:13.000 --> 06:13.840
Director,

94
06:15.120 --> 06:16.840
is it possible

95
06:16.840 --> 06:19.200
for you to stall the approval?

96
06:19.760 --> 06:21.840
If there's anything you need, just let me know.

97
06:22.440 --> 06:24.000
I'll see what I can do, Mr. Ing.

98
06:24.400 --> 06:25.000
Okay.

99
06:25.640 --> 06:26.360
Thank you very much.

100
06:26.400 --> 06:28.080
I'll be sure to return the favor.

101
06:31.840 --> 06:33.280
Dammit.

102
06:33.880 --> 06:35.360
We've been played for fools.

103
06:36.040 --> 06:36.960
What happened?

104
06:36.960 --> 06:39.480
That couple secretly switched the shareholder's name.

105
06:39.840 --> 06:41.240
They submitted the documents

106
06:41.240 --> 06:42.880
listing a different company.

107
06:49.680 --> 06:50.800
Take a look for yourself.

108
06:59.720 --> 07:02.440
"Pitak Real Estate Development Co., Ltd."

109
07:03.560 --> 07:06.160
Registered capital is only fifty thousand baht.

110
07:07.200 --> 07:09.800
The director's name is Mr. Thanapong.

111
07:10.400 --> 07:12.560
With this little info, it's definitely a nominee.

112
07:12.720 --> 07:13.880
Go check it out.

113
07:13.920 --> 07:15.040
If the data is identical to ours,

114
07:15.040 --> 07:16.760
it means it's an inside job.

115
07:16.920 --> 07:17.880
As for this Mr. Pong,

116
07:17.880 --> 07:19.480
find out exactly who he is.

117
07:20.000 --> 07:20.840
Understood.

118
07:36.000 --> 07:38.560
Do you not know, or are you hiding something from me?

119
07:43.400 --> 07:44.760
For Yok's sake,

120
07:45.680 --> 07:47.120
I'll get to the bottom of it first.

121
08:07.520 --> 08:08.360
Come in.

122
08:17.240 --> 08:18.720
Whoa.

123
08:19.800 --> 08:21.320
Thought you said you were coming the day after tomorrow?

124
08:23.640 --> 08:24.400
Hey.

125
08:24.840 --> 08:26.280
I'm working.

126
08:29.240 --> 08:30.520
Stop smoking already.

127
08:36.400 --> 08:39.400
I was just worried that someone around here

128
08:39.440 --> 08:41.120
would be so busy working he'd forget to eat,

129
08:41.360 --> 08:42.400
so I made him this.

130
08:44.600 --> 08:45.720
I'm just finding out

131
08:45.720 --> 08:47.720
how great it is to date someone younger.

132
08:53.720 --> 08:54.760
Shrimp, too.

133
08:54.800 --> 08:56.440
How did you know I wanted shrimp?

134
08:58.640 --> 09:00.640
Isn't it your favorite?

135
09:04.960 --> 09:05.760
P'Ing,

136
09:05.920 --> 09:08.360
wanna head home together after you finish eating?

137
09:09.200 --> 09:10.040
Yok,

138
09:10.840 --> 09:12.320
to be honest, I'm exhausted.

139
09:12.360 --> 09:13.400
I still haven't finished my work.

140
09:13.440 --> 09:15.200
The Pattaya project is giving me a massive headache.

141
09:19.480 --> 09:20.200
Oh?

142
09:20.920 --> 09:21.920
Are you mad?

143
09:23.840 --> 09:24.800
Tell you what.

144
09:25.200 --> 09:26.040
Once I'm done with work,

145
09:26.080 --> 09:27.160
how about we go for a swim

146
09:27.200 --> 09:28.960
in our new pool?

147
09:31.080 --> 09:32.680
That's more like it.

148
09:34.760 --> 09:35.840
Now, eat up.

149
09:37.920 --> 09:39.480
Should I stop eating now?

150
09:41.400 --> 09:41.960
No.

151
09:42.000 --> 09:42.800
I'll eat the shrimp.

152
09:49.480 --> 09:50.680
If I don't want this shrimp,

153
09:51.360 --> 09:52.840
can I have some tiny shrimp instead?

154
09:59.840 --> 10:01.800
Thanapong is a local.

155
10:01.840 --> 10:03.400
Someone paid him a hundred thousand in cash

156
10:03.440 --> 10:05.120
to register the company,

157
10:05.160 --> 10:06.400
and he agreed to do it.

158
10:08.040 --> 10:09.920
Okay. Thank you.

159
10:20.120 --> 10:20.920
P'Ing,

160
10:21.480 --> 10:22.640
is something wrong?

161
10:24.280 --> 10:26.400
Oh, it's nothing.

162
10:42.440 --> 10:44.520
Honestly, I feel really bad for you.

163
10:45.440 --> 10:46.960
I thought this project should've been

164
10:47.000 --> 10:49.320
a perfect wrap-up before you left for America.

165
10:50.520 --> 10:53.200
But in the end, it's just been a total mess.

166
10:55.680 --> 10:57.000
Let's stop talking about work.

167
11:00.760 --> 11:01.960
Are you a strong swimmer?

168
11:03.200 --> 11:04.160
Why?

169
11:04.400 --> 11:05.880
I'm going to ride on your back.

170
11:08.160 --> 11:09.840
Then how am I supposed to swim?

171
11:09.880 --> 11:11.480
You don't have to swim. Just walk.

172
11:14.200 --> 11:14.920
P'Ing...

173
11:14.920 --> 11:15.640
What?

174
11:15.680 --> 11:16.600
What kind of prank is this?

175
11:16.600 --> 11:17.560
It's nothing.

176
11:22.960 --> 11:23.880
Want to do it underwater?

177
11:24.320 --> 11:25.240
Want to give it a try?

178
11:25.280 --> 11:26.240
-No. -Come here.

179
11:26.280 --> 11:27.200
Come on.

180
11:27.280 --> 11:28.160
Hold on.

181
11:29.640 --> 11:30.520
P'Ing.

182
11:32.160 --> 11:33.240
Are you trying to tease me?

183
11:33.440 --> 11:35.640
Should we just do it underwater?

184
11:36.000 --> 11:37.520
Let's go over there instead.

185
11:46.120 --> 11:48.080
Dragon fruit today, huh?

186
11:48.480 --> 11:49.280
Yes.

187
11:50.080 --> 11:52.000
I really love dragon fruit.

188
11:53.240 --> 11:54.600
Take the seeds out, too.

189
11:56.520 --> 11:57.840
Are you messing with me?

190
11:57.960 --> 11:59.880
I'm not. I'm serious.

191
12:00.280 --> 12:01.520
Can you wait, then?

192
12:01.680 --> 12:03.840
I could wait an eternity.

193
12:06.160 --> 12:07.720
Your phone has been ringing nonstop.

194
12:07.920 --> 12:09.400
Should you answer it?

195
12:10.320 --> 12:11.680
Who is it?

196
12:11.960 --> 12:14.440
How could they ruin my day?

197
12:15.080 --> 12:16.280
I'll give them a piece of my mind.

198
12:19.160 --> 12:20.200
You should answer it.

199
12:20.720 --> 12:21.840
Okay.

200
12:23.160 --> 12:24.280
Let's see

201
12:24.520 --> 12:27.320
who's trying to ruin the mood.

202
12:30.520 --> 12:31.160
Oh...

203
12:32.280 --> 12:33.360
It's Pite.

204
12:41.880 --> 12:43.600
The number you have dialed is not in service.

205
12:43.640 --> 12:46.080
Please check the number and try again.

206
12:53.960 --> 12:54.720
Auntie,

207
12:54.920 --> 12:56.200
has Pite already left?

208
12:56.400 --> 12:57.280
He has.

209
12:57.520 --> 12:58.840
He just left today.

210
12:59.160 --> 13:00.200
I know...

211
13:00.440 --> 13:02.560
you did this for his own good,

212
13:03.280 --> 13:04.960
but as his mother,

213
13:05.440 --> 13:07.400
it's just so painful.

214
13:08.640 --> 13:11.240
Auntie, to be honest with you,

215
13:11.280 --> 13:13.160
I'm upset about it, too,

216
13:13.440 --> 13:14.960
but it's for his own sake.

217
13:15.360 --> 13:16.680
Once he gets out of there,

218
13:16.680 --> 13:18.560
he'll definitely be more of a grown man.

219
13:19.360 --> 13:20.000
Yeah.

220
13:20.480 --> 13:22.400
I actually miss him, too.

221
13:23.240 --> 13:25.120
Yes. Please don't worry.

222
13:27.720 --> 13:29.800
Good riddance, you little jerk.

223
13:29.840 --> 13:30.840
Dammit.

224
13:31.680 --> 13:32.680
You know what?

225
13:33.000 --> 13:34.840
I've been giving him money since he was a kid.

226
13:34.880 --> 13:35.680
If it weren't for me,

227
13:35.720 --> 13:37.840
he would've gotten beaten up so many times.

228
13:38.280 --> 13:40.280
But then he had the nerve to double-cross me.

229
13:40.280 --> 13:42.240
Can you believe how shameless he is?

230
13:46.640 --> 13:47.760
Oh, hold on a second.

231
13:54.000 --> 13:54.920
Look at this.

232
13:58.200 --> 13:59.840
Even though the Pattaya project hit a snag,

233
13:59.880 --> 14:01.080
I have a new project to show you.

234
14:01.120 --> 14:03.120
Here, it's a massive one.

235
14:07.000 --> 14:08.720
The land in the north of Phuket?

236
14:09.240 --> 14:10.960
This is the exact same set of data

237
14:10.960 --> 14:12.720
that Itt sent me last time.

238
14:12.760 --> 14:14.000
Wow.

239
14:14.000 --> 14:17.080
What a memory. You're so smart.

240
14:21.960 --> 14:23.040
The location is good.

241
14:23.560 --> 14:24.560
How much of an investment is required?

242
14:27.360 --> 14:28.360
Take a guess.

243
14:36.440 --> 14:37.440
I wouldn't know.

244
14:39.760 --> 14:40.760
Ten billion.

245
14:41.720 --> 14:42.840
Ten billion?

246
14:44.600 --> 14:46.640
Where are you gonna get that much money?

247
14:47.520 --> 14:48.240
I've checked.

248
14:48.280 --> 14:50.320
The company's current cash flow

249
14:50.520 --> 14:52.520
is over a billion.

250
14:52.920 --> 14:54.120
The only thing left is

251
14:54.160 --> 14:55.760
to put our projects up as collateral.

252
14:55.760 --> 14:57.160
I've already spoken to the bank.

253
14:58.080 --> 15:00.160
I'll mortgage the projects in Damnoen Saduak

254
15:00.160 --> 15:01.440
and Samui.

255
15:01.480 --> 15:03.840
That'll cover the full amount.

256
15:05.920 --> 15:07.360
Have you checked everything thoroughly?

257
15:07.760 --> 15:09.120
I've checked every detail.

258
15:09.160 --> 15:11.120
I even sent a team to the site twice,

259
15:11.160 --> 15:13.800
and they said the location is prime.

260
15:18.000 --> 15:19.280
I don't support this.

261
15:19.840 --> 15:21.200
It's way too risky.

262
15:22.760 --> 15:23.680
What?

263
15:25.840 --> 15:28.440
Since when did my Yok become such a cautious guy?

264
15:28.840 --> 15:30.600
Now, listen.

265
15:31.240 --> 15:32.440
Business...

266
15:32.600 --> 15:34.240
is different from politics, you know?

267
15:35.400 --> 15:36.880
It's about high risk, high return.

268
15:36.880 --> 15:37.800
You can't just play it safe,

269
15:37.840 --> 15:39.240
or you won't get rich.

270
15:40.520 --> 15:42.520
What about the funds for your other projects?

271
15:42.640 --> 15:44.120
If even one thing goes wrong,

272
15:44.200 --> 15:45.600
it'll trigger a chain reaction.

273
15:46.520 --> 15:47.920
Why so fierce?

274
15:48.480 --> 15:49.280
Don't overthink it.

275
15:49.320 --> 15:51.440
I'm just pitching an idea.

276
15:51.720 --> 15:52.800
What's there to be afraid of?

277
15:53.640 --> 15:54.720
My brother...

278
15:55.120 --> 15:56.640
hates nothing more than being lied to.

279
15:58.720 --> 16:00.800
The second you helped me,

280
16:01.640 --> 16:02.840
you'd already betrayed him.

281
16:03.520 --> 16:05.000
Then promise me

282
16:05.840 --> 16:08.520
you'll always do your research before taking any risks.

283
16:13.200 --> 16:14.280
What's with you today?

284
16:14.600 --> 16:16.520
You sound like a nagging old man.

285
16:17.920 --> 16:19.400
I'm just worried about you.

286
16:20.960 --> 16:21.960
Worried?

287
16:22.320 --> 16:23.480
Why would you be worried?

288
16:25.600 --> 16:28.040
I'm just worried that once I'm abroad,

289
16:28.280 --> 16:29.920
there won't be anyone to keep you in check.

290
16:33.480 --> 16:36.400
So you're actually hooked on me.

291
16:37.160 --> 16:38.200
Oh, right.

292
16:38.680 --> 16:40.480
You're going to America next week.

293
16:41.280 --> 16:43.400
I'm sorry.

294
16:44.000 --> 16:46.040
I've been so wrapped up in work I lost track of time.

295
16:46.480 --> 16:48.960
I promise I'll be extra good in bed from now on.

296
16:52.080 --> 16:53.440
Don't be sorry.

297
16:54.600 --> 16:55.960
It's not your fault.

298
16:57.200 --> 16:57.920
Here.

299
17:02.840 --> 17:04.280
As for mine...

300
17:04.480 --> 17:05.560
take the seeds out, too.

301
17:29.760 --> 17:32.000
[Director Phadung]

302
17:34.520 --> 17:36.760
Hello. You've got the information, right?

303
17:37.360 --> 17:38.120
Yes.

304
17:38.640 --> 17:40.520
Regarding that plot of land in Phuket,

305
17:40.840 --> 17:43.440
the person who contacted the government is...

306
17:44.120 --> 17:45.000
Mr. Itt.

307
17:45.680 --> 17:47.880
Previously, he also submitted

308
17:47.920 --> 17:50.520
the bilateral report himself.

309
17:51.280 --> 17:52.520
Thank you very much, Director.

310
18:12.040 --> 18:12.920
Itt...

311
18:15.720 --> 18:16.960
I need to have a word with you.

312
18:17.560 --> 18:19.320
Sure. What is it?

313
18:21.760 --> 18:24.160
Mr. Ing, could you please sign these two documents?

314
18:24.280 --> 18:25.440
What are you smiling about?

315
18:28.400 --> 18:30.520
Mr. Yok has been gone for days.

316
18:31.080 --> 18:33.000
He's back today, and his outfit is....

317
18:33.800 --> 18:34.720
so cute.

318
18:38.560 --> 18:39.800
He's here?

319
18:39.840 --> 18:40.680
Yes.

320
18:41.280 --> 18:42.320
I just walked past him a moment ago.

321
18:42.320 --> 18:44.960
It looks like he's headed to a meeting with Mr. Itt

322
18:45.120 --> 18:46.320
or someone.

323
18:48.480 --> 18:50.280
What do those two need to meet about?

324
18:50.320 --> 18:51.560
I'm not sure.

325
18:52.040 --> 18:53.280
Would you like me to ask them?

326
18:53.280 --> 18:54.440
Oh, no need.

327
18:55.520 --> 18:56.520
I'll ask them myself.

328
19:04.000 --> 19:05.600
You've checked my laptop,

329
19:06.480 --> 19:08.400
even my entire chat history.

330
19:09.800 --> 19:11.600
Can you trust me now?

331
19:12.040 --> 19:13.200
I wasn't using the Phuket project

332
19:13.200 --> 19:14.440
to set a trap for anyone.

333
19:16.640 --> 19:18.080
I already told you.

334
19:18.720 --> 19:20.840
All I wanted was to get my cut from the Pattaya project.

335
19:21.680 --> 19:24.040
I only helped a colleague write that report.

336
19:27.080 --> 19:29.800
I'm sorry for doubting you.

337
19:42.320 --> 19:44.040
We've been friends for so many years.

338
19:47.200 --> 19:48.560
Don't you trust me at all?

339
19:53.200 --> 19:53.960
Itt,

340
19:54.280 --> 19:55.640
I'm so sorry.

341
19:56.680 --> 19:58.200
I let my emotions get the better of me.

342
19:59.480 --> 20:01.080
I didn't have any other motives.

343
20:01.320 --> 20:02.200
You know,

344
20:03.000 --> 20:04.520
you weren't like this.

345
20:18.840 --> 20:19.800
Where are they?

346
20:22.320 --> 20:23.360
I just don't understand.

347
20:24.520 --> 20:25.560
You told me

348
20:25.560 --> 20:27.240
that there was no way you'd ever be into guys.

349
20:30.560 --> 20:32.120
It's not like that, Itt.

350
20:46.080 --> 20:47.480
Let me ask you something.

351
20:51.760 --> 20:53.200
Do you actually like my brother?

352
20:55.360 --> 20:57.680
When you realized you were into guys...

353
21:03.240 --> 21:04.680
did you actually have a crush on me?

354
21:15.440 --> 21:16.320
Yeah.

355
21:16.880 --> 21:18.440
I really wanted to tell you how I felt.

356
21:19.680 --> 21:20.480
Itt, you...

357
21:21.720 --> 21:22.480
How dare you.

358
21:22.520 --> 21:23.320
P'Ing.

359
21:24.200 --> 21:25.200
Hey, P'Ing.

360
21:25.600 --> 21:26.440
P'Ing, hey.

361
21:26.480 --> 21:27.160
Hey.

362
21:27.360 --> 21:28.720
Calm down, P'Ing.

363
21:28.760 --> 21:30.680
Calm down? Are you kidding me?

364
21:31.120 --> 21:32.520
Calm down?

365
21:33.040 --> 21:34.480
You think I'm an idiot?

366
21:34.520 --> 21:36.600
You think you can just play me for a fool?

367
21:38.120 --> 21:39.000
And you, Itt.

368
21:39.000 --> 21:40.640
You have the nerve to steal from me?

369
21:41.160 --> 21:42.240
I asked you a question.

370
21:42.280 --> 21:43.920
-How dare you. -P'Ing...

371
21:44.120 --> 21:44.720
P'Ing...

372
21:44.720 --> 21:45.480
Please.

373
21:46.400 --> 21:47.480
What's your problem?

374
21:48.480 --> 21:49.360
I see.

375
21:51.120 --> 21:52.200
You were playing hard to get

376
21:52.200 --> 21:53.320
because of this jerk, huh?

377
21:53.760 --> 21:55.920
You've got eyes, but you're as blind as a bat.

378
21:56.160 --> 21:57.480
You might as well donate them.

379
21:58.760 --> 21:59.440
P'Ing...

380
21:59.480 --> 22:00.760
Please let me explain first.

381
22:00.800 --> 22:01.880
Explain what?

382
22:02.840 --> 22:04.200
Listen to me, both of you.

383
22:04.640 --> 22:06.320
Don't let me see your faces here again.

384
22:07.960 --> 22:08.880
Dammit.

385
22:11.040 --> 22:11.600
Hey.

386
22:11.600 --> 22:12.880
He's furious right now.

387
22:12.920 --> 22:14.120
There's no use saying anything.

388
22:14.160 --> 22:15.160
Leave me alone.

389
22:15.200 --> 22:16.160
I need to talk to him.

390
22:23.320 --> 22:25.320
P'Ing... Hey.

391
22:30.440 --> 22:34.440
♪ Now it's breaking me apart ♪

392
22:35.360 --> 22:42.160
♪ It's my fault for every broken part we had ♪

393
22:46.000 --> 22:49.240
♪ We had a warm run, babe ♪

394
22:49.280 --> 22:52.960
♪ I messed up all that we were ♪

395
22:53.000 --> 22:55.840
[20 missed calls from Yok]

396
22:57.880 --> 22:58.680
Dammit.

397
22:58.680 --> 23:04.160
♪ Our sweetest spark turned to the dark ♪

398
23:04.200 --> 23:05.160
Damn...

399
23:06.080 --> 23:09.160
♪ Turned to the dark ♪

400
23:09.160 --> 23:14.200
♪ I know what I have done wrong ♪

401
23:15.040 --> 23:16.040
Itt...

402
23:20.560 --> 23:22.320
You know that we can't go public,

403
23:22.320 --> 23:23.520
but you did that today

404
23:24.280 --> 23:26.560
while P'Phet and Itt were right there.

405
23:33.960 --> 23:34.840
What's this?

406
23:36.040 --> 23:37.760
If I gave you a ring, would you take it?

407
23:41.200 --> 23:43.000
That sentence you didn't get to finish...

408
23:44.280 --> 23:45.640
You'd say you liked me, right?

409
23:46.360 --> 23:47.080
Yeah.

410
23:47.560 --> 23:48.640
Dammit.

411
23:49.960 --> 23:51.440
Just go to hell, Yok.

412
24:11.800 --> 24:12.680
This little jerk...

413
24:15.880 --> 24:17.240
Who let you into my house?

414
24:19.680 --> 24:21.200
We need to talk, P'Ing.

415
24:21.640 --> 24:22.920
Talk about what? Go talk to Itt.

416
24:22.960 --> 24:23.920
I don't want to talk to you.

417
24:25.040 --> 24:25.920
I only want to see you.

418
24:25.920 --> 24:27.360
But I don't want to see you.

419
24:28.720 --> 24:30.160
Can you just calm down?

420
24:30.200 --> 24:31.440
Stop yelling at me.

421
24:33.240 --> 24:34.160
Fine, talk.

422
24:37.160 --> 24:38.440
Stay away from me.

423
24:42.080 --> 24:43.360
Just listen to me.

424
24:47.160 --> 24:48.280
I admit it.

425
24:49.240 --> 24:51.360
I really couldn't understand my feelings.

426
24:52.360 --> 24:54.800
I felt like I wanted to protect Itt when we were younger.

427
24:57.680 --> 24:59.000
Protect him from what?

428
25:01.640 --> 25:02.920
Please listen to me.

429
25:06.400 --> 25:07.920
When I first met him,

430
25:08.800 --> 25:11.600
he told me you'd always bullied him.

431
25:15.800 --> 25:17.160
Help me.

432
25:18.920 --> 25:21.440
P'Ing, please pull me up.

433
25:28.560 --> 25:30.080
What? That situation?

434
25:31.040 --> 25:32.240
Are you out of your mind?

435
25:33.760 --> 25:35.440
I was actually teaching him how to swim.

436
25:35.440 --> 25:36.560
He didn't know how to swim.

437
25:36.600 --> 25:38.680
Then his mom saw us and made a huge scene,

438
25:38.680 --> 25:40.000
so I never got to finish teaching him.

439
25:40.080 --> 25:41.320
Now listen to me.

440
25:41.440 --> 25:42.560
If I really wanted to kill him,

441
25:42.560 --> 25:44.040
I would have just kicked him into the pool.

442
25:47.480 --> 25:49.520
I'm right here. You're not going to die.

443
25:50.120 --> 25:52.040
Please pull me up.

444
25:52.520 --> 25:53.640
P'Ing, please.

445
25:53.880 --> 25:55.200
Don't be such a wimp.

446
25:55.320 --> 25:56.440
The water only reaches your chest.

447
25:57.040 --> 25:58.160
Now, stand up.

448
25:59.360 --> 26:00.720
P'Ing, help me.

449
26:01.680 --> 26:02.480
Itt.

450
26:02.520 --> 26:03.960
Let go of my son right now.

451
26:09.320 --> 26:11.640
Don't let him teach you anything now.

452
26:14.280 --> 26:15.160
[Swimming Manual for Children]

453
26:16.000 --> 26:16.720
Yok,

454
26:17.360 --> 26:18.760
is the Ing you know

455
26:19.320 --> 26:20.800
really that stupid?

456
26:21.000 --> 26:21.800
Is he?

457
26:23.040 --> 26:24.760
I admit...

458
26:24.840 --> 26:26.280
that I act like a tyrant

459
26:26.320 --> 26:27.280
and have a nasty temper,

460
26:27.320 --> 26:28.960
but I've never tried to hurt anyone.

461
26:32.520 --> 26:33.720
Okay, maybe a little bit.

462
26:34.520 --> 26:35.720
But if I wanted to be cruel,

463
26:35.960 --> 26:37.840
he and his mom wouldn't be living in my house.

464
26:40.600 --> 26:42.240
I didn't know you back then.

465
26:43.400 --> 26:44.920
I only knew one side of the story.

466
26:48.440 --> 26:49.800
I heard what Itt's mom said, and...

467
26:50.280 --> 26:51.280
when I met you,

468
26:51.680 --> 26:53.280
you were always on a power trip with him.

469
26:53.360 --> 26:55.320
I only act that way because of his mom.

470
26:55.360 --> 26:56.720
It's got nothing to do with him.

471
26:56.960 --> 26:58.920
I've always seen him as my brother.

472
26:58.920 --> 27:01.160
Otherwise, why would I let him intern at my company?

473
27:01.720 --> 27:02.360
Why?

474
27:02.400 --> 27:04.200
Why would I have let him take on major projects?

475
27:04.200 --> 27:05.680
I wouldn't have given him those opportunities.

476
27:13.280 --> 27:14.080
Ing...

477
27:16.120 --> 27:17.240
From now on,

478
27:18.400 --> 27:20.440
you must take good care of your younger brother.

479
27:31.920 --> 27:33.080
I'm entrusting him to you.

480
27:38.320 --> 27:39.200
Give it back.

481
27:39.200 --> 27:40.640
Hey, give it back.

482
27:40.680 --> 27:41.760
Give it back to me.

483
27:42.280 --> 27:43.280
Give it to me.

484
27:45.040 --> 27:47.440
He's my brother. Only I can mess with him.

485
27:48.160 --> 27:49.160
You want some more?

486
27:50.160 --> 27:51.320
Huh? You want more?

487
27:52.800 --> 27:53.680
Do you?

488
27:57.320 --> 27:58.720
Yeah, I admit it.

489
27:59.800 --> 28:01.640
My patience with him is paper-thin.

490
28:01.680 --> 28:02.720
Just look at him.

491
28:02.920 --> 28:04.240
He's such a crybaby.

492
28:04.240 --> 28:05.800
It's only natural that I'd be annoyed.

493
28:06.240 --> 28:07.440
Listen to me.

494
28:07.480 --> 28:09.080
Given what his mom did to me,

495
28:09.120 --> 28:10.520
you could say I went pretty easy on him.

496
28:14.800 --> 28:15.960
I get it now.

497
28:18.760 --> 28:20.440
You may act tough, but you're actually kind.

498
28:21.680 --> 28:22.960
It's my fault

499
28:23.800 --> 28:25.880
for believing only what Itt told me.

500
28:29.800 --> 28:31.120
Finally.

501
28:36.160 --> 28:38.040
We've cleared the air now, right?

502
28:39.440 --> 28:41.240
I'm leaving in two days.

503
28:42.160 --> 28:44.280
I don't want us to have any more misunderstandings.

504
28:45.760 --> 28:46.560
Yeah, I know.

505
28:49.800 --> 28:50.680
P'Ing.

506
28:51.640 --> 28:52.920
Please forgive me.

507
28:54.320 --> 28:55.760
How can I make it up to you?

508
29:03.600 --> 29:04.520
It's simple.

509
29:06.280 --> 29:07.680
Just be on the bottom

510
29:07.680 --> 29:09.120
and let me top you.

511
29:12.320 --> 29:14.440
I figured you'd say that.

512
29:16.760 --> 29:17.840
Then...

513
29:18.360 --> 29:19.840
how about we save it for your birthday?

514
29:22.040 --> 29:23.440
You can fly out to see me,

515
29:23.640 --> 29:24.720
or...

516
29:24.960 --> 29:26.480
I can fly back here to see you.

517
29:27.680 --> 29:29.600
I'll let you have your way then.

518
29:30.520 --> 29:32.160
But...

519
29:32.960 --> 29:33.800
as for right now...

520
29:33.840 --> 29:34.560
What?

521
29:35.320 --> 29:37.600
Hey. Hey...

522
29:38.080 --> 29:40.680
No, I want it today. Stop now.

523
29:57.320 --> 29:58.520
P'Ing.

524
29:58.520 --> 30:00.720
P'Ing, help me.

525
30:00.760 --> 30:01.960
P'Ing.

526
30:02.920 --> 30:03.920
P'Ing...

527
30:04.160 --> 30:05.320
What's up, you little jerk?

528
30:05.680 --> 30:06.560
P'Ing...

529
30:06.600 --> 30:09.240
Please help me. I'm so sorry.

530
30:10.760 --> 30:12.080
Please let me come home.

531
30:12.360 --> 30:13.560
If you keep me here any longer,

532
30:13.560 --> 30:15.560
I'm going to lose my mind.

533
30:15.600 --> 30:16.880
Shut up, Pite.

534
30:17.040 --> 30:18.440
Stop your damn screaming.

535
30:19.400 --> 30:21.120
If you want to come back, listen to me.

536
30:21.160 --> 30:22.440
Just give me my condo units back

537
30:22.480 --> 30:24.320
or pay me back every single cent.

538
30:24.320 --> 30:25.720
Come on, P'Ing...

539
30:25.720 --> 30:28.320
How am I supposed to get that kind of money?

540
30:29.040 --> 30:29.800
I'm begging you.

541
30:29.800 --> 30:31.920
This place is a total wasteland.

542
30:31.920 --> 30:32.960
There's no signal.

543
30:33.000 --> 30:34.280
There aren't even any girls.

544
30:34.320 --> 30:35.920
I have to wake up at five every morning,

545
30:36.080 --> 30:37.800
and I'm getting hazed left and right.

546
30:37.800 --> 30:41.280
Please let me come back. I'm begging you.

547
30:41.800 --> 30:43.480
Listen to me, Pite.

548
30:43.800 --> 30:45.000
All these years,

549
30:45.000 --> 30:46.440
when have I ever wronged you?

550
30:46.560 --> 30:48.760
I've always taken care of you and given you money.

551
30:48.800 --> 30:51.240
But you chose to repay me by ripping me off.

552
30:54.880 --> 30:55.720
P'Ing...

553
30:55.760 --> 30:57.520
I'm really sorry.

554
30:57.560 --> 30:59.280
I didn't mean to do it.

555
30:59.800 --> 31:01.400
I was in so much debt.

556
31:01.400 --> 31:03.080
They had a gun pointed at my neck.

557
31:03.080 --> 31:05.440
Was I just supposed to let them kill me?

558
31:06.480 --> 31:07.560
Besides,

559
31:08.040 --> 31:09.320
Itt told me to do it.

560
31:09.360 --> 31:11.400
I wouldn't have the guts to do it on my own.

561
31:12.120 --> 31:13.080
Wait, Pite.

562
31:13.480 --> 31:14.680
What did you just say?

563
31:15.200 --> 31:16.480
P'Ing...

564
31:16.920 --> 31:18.920
The reason I've been avoiding you

565
31:19.080 --> 31:21.000
isn't because I was afraid you'd beat me up.

566
31:21.720 --> 31:23.600
Well, I was afraid of that, too.

567
31:23.600 --> 31:25.120
Pite, start talking.

568
31:25.440 --> 31:26.480
What does Itt have to do with this?

569
31:26.520 --> 31:27.080
Tell me

570
31:27.080 --> 31:27.840
what he has to do with this.

571
31:27.840 --> 31:30.720
Please help me. I'm scared.

572
31:41.320 --> 31:43.480
P'Ing, you should cut back on smoking.

573
31:43.520 --> 31:44.440
Get over here.

574
31:50.800 --> 31:52.400
Pite called me today.

575
31:54.480 --> 31:55.360
Care to guess...

576
31:56.160 --> 31:57.320
what he had to say?

577
31:59.720 --> 32:01.280
I assume he was begging you

578
32:01.280 --> 32:03.000
to let him come home.

579
32:05.280 --> 32:06.120
Exactly.

580
32:17.880 --> 32:19.400
He also told me...

581
32:20.840 --> 32:23.440
that those three condo units I intended for Mr. Pha-nu

582
32:25.240 --> 32:26.560
have been pocketed by you.

583
32:39.800 --> 32:41.800
You wanna die that badly?

584
32:43.400 --> 32:44.200
Guess what?

585
32:44.920 --> 32:46.840
My plan was full of holes,

586
32:48.040 --> 32:49.720
but you didn't suspect me at all.

587
32:51.120 --> 32:52.520
Since you trusted me so much,

588
32:53.400 --> 32:54.680
I'm genuinely touched.

589
32:55.160 --> 32:56.240
You little punk.

590
32:57.880 --> 32:58.680
What?

591
32:59.720 --> 33:01.960
This is the birthday gift you gave me.

592
33:09.320 --> 33:10.760
I'm not that same little brother

593
33:11.280 --> 33:13.440
you can bully whenever you feel like it anymore.

594
33:18.360 --> 33:19.440
Ing, Itt.

595
33:19.640 --> 33:20.720
Open the door right now.

596
33:20.720 --> 33:21.920
Stop fighting.

597
33:22.240 --> 33:23.320
-Itt. -Open the door.

598
33:23.360 --> 33:24.480
-Ing. -Open the door.

599
33:24.680 --> 33:25.720
Ing, Itt.

600
33:26.000 --> 33:26.880
Stop fighting this instant.

601
33:26.920 --> 33:28.960
I love the look on your face right now.

602
33:30.640 --> 33:31.920
It's like...

603
33:33.560 --> 33:34.840
in your eyes,

604
33:35.760 --> 33:37.440
everyone is just trash.

605
33:40.480 --> 33:41.640
What a waste...

606
33:42.920 --> 33:44.640
I actually thought about being nice to you.

607
33:45.680 --> 33:46.680
Being nice to me?

608
33:47.720 --> 33:48.520
Why?

609
33:49.040 --> 33:50.360
Because of a jerk like Yok?

610
33:52.360 --> 33:53.960
Stay the hell out of this.

611
33:57.480 --> 33:59.800
I love it when you're so mad you're literally shaking

612
34:00.640 --> 34:02.000
but can't do a thing about it.

613
34:06.760 --> 34:08.719
Since we were kids, you've always acted so superior

614
34:08.760 --> 34:10.040
and looked down on me.

615
34:11.040 --> 34:12.120
I kept dreaming

616
34:12.679 --> 34:14.199
about what it would be like

617
34:14.920 --> 34:16.040
to have the upper hand over you.

618
34:19.639 --> 34:20.440
Damn you.

619
34:25.320 --> 34:26.639
Hey, Ing.

620
34:27.960 --> 34:29.120
You're hitting your brother again.

621
34:29.600 --> 34:30.920
You're an adult now.

622
34:31.360 --> 34:32.600
Why do you keep doing this to him?

623
34:32.639 --> 34:34.800
Because this jerk did some messed-up things to me.

624
34:35.120 --> 34:36.560
Stop taking his side already.

625
34:37.360 --> 34:38.040
By the way,

626
34:39.520 --> 34:40.840
you should know...

627
34:41.600 --> 34:44.040
that this isn't entirely my fault.

628
34:45.560 --> 34:46.600
As for the rest,

629
34:47.800 --> 34:49.320
why don't you ask Yok?

630
35:16.880 --> 35:17.640
Hello?

631
35:17.640 --> 35:18.680
Mr. Ing,

632
35:18.720 --> 35:20.560
the investigation is complete.

633
35:21.080 --> 35:23.360
This file contains Mr. Itt's financial records.

634
35:24.240 --> 35:25.520
From these records,

635
35:25.640 --> 35:28.560
I also managed to track down Private Equity

636
35:28.680 --> 35:31.480
that's behind Green Agriculture.

637
35:32.000 --> 35:32.880
Mr. Ing,

638
35:33.120 --> 35:34.600
please prepare yourself before opening it.

639
35:34.640 --> 35:36.080
There are two shareholders.

640
35:50.880 --> 35:56.880
[Major Shareholders Prutta, Tottiwa]

641
36:45.920 --> 36:47.120
Get a doctor in here.

642
36:47.120 --> 36:49.320
I don't care if they give me drugs or electric shocks.

643
36:49.360 --> 36:51.440
Just make it all stop so I can finally rest.

644
36:51.600 --> 36:52.840
What's going on between you and Mr. Ing?

645
36:52.840 --> 36:53.720
Have you met him yet?

646
36:53.760 --> 36:55.800
Instead of wasting your time on me,

647
36:55.800 --> 36:57.640
you should be helping your brother.

648
36:57.840 --> 36:59.200
What happened to P'Phet?

649
36:59.240 --> 37:01.160
Quit Araya Group right now.

650
37:01.360 --> 37:02.680
Thanks so much

651
37:02.720 --> 37:04.920
for giving me all the love that wasn't even real.

652
37:05.560 --> 37:07.600
From now on,

653
37:07.880 --> 37:09.000
we're over.

654
37:09.040 --> 37:10.280
P'Ing, wait...

655
37:10.320 --> 37:12.560
-We can't end things like this. -Dammit.

656
37:12.560 --> 37:13.880
Once this is settled,

657
37:14.320 --> 37:15.760
I'll come back to you.
